@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms and Platform Rules</PageTitle>

<main class="policy-page">
    <h1>Rustles Terms and Platform Rules</h1>
    <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: June 5, 2026</p>

    <section>
        <h2>Age rule</h2>
        <p>Rustles is intended for users who are at least 16 years old. You must confirm this before creating an account.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Public municipality chat</h2>
        <p>
            Rustles places you in a public municipality chat based on live location resolution. Other people in that
            municipality room can read your messages, replies, and reactions.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>User rules</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Be respectful and considerate toward other users.</li>
            <li>Do not harass, threaten, impersonate, stalk, or target other people.</li>
            <li>Do not post private, identifying, or sensitive information about yourself or others.</li>
            <li>Do not spam, flood, manipulate, or abuse the service.</li>
            <li>Do not post illegal content or use Rustles for illegal conduct.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Platform actions</h2>
        <p>
            Rustles may limit, disable, or remove access where abusive or unsafe behavior is reasonably suspected. The
            current product is early, but trusted testers may remove messages and ban users from a municipality chat
            where the tooling supports it.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Service limits</h2>
        <p>
            Rustles is an early-stage service. It may change, break, or become unavailable. Do not rely on public chat
            as permanent storage for important information.
        </p>
    </section>
</main>
